[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1475","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1475.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1313","title":"FreeBSD man 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 2.2 及更早版本中的手册页阅读器（man）存在权限提升漏洞，本地用户可通过特定命令序列获取额外权限","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1313"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1996-05-23T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 至 2.2.5 或更高版本，或移除 man 程序的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/man）","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.freebsd.org/security/advisories/FreeBSD-SA-96:11.man.asc","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7348"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1475.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1476","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1476.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1314","title":"FreeBSD union 文件系统本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 2.2 及更早版本中的 union 联合文件系统存在拒绝服务漏洞，本地用户可通过执行一系列特制的 mount_union 命令触发系统重载，导致系统临时不可用。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 2.2 及更早版本，也可能波及其他使用 union 文件系统的操作系统。由于需要本地访问权限且不涉及数据泄露，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1314"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-05-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:10Z","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 至 2.2 以上版本，该漏洞已在 FreeBSD-SA-96:10 公告对应的补丁中修复。当前所有受支持的 FreeBSD 版本（11.x 及以上）均不受此漏洞影响，建议运行 `freebsd-version` 确认系统版本，如低于 2.2 请立即升级至最新稳定版。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/g-24.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7429.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3dea9b9f675980a583148876f0551475ad122e1/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1314.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1314","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1314.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3f415771bcfb63723b9c0d3f106f197a1964d0e2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1314.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-fvmp-q3gf-w4cv/GHSA-fvmp-q3gf-w4cv.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x85000/84444/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1314.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000082.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a3ca9303-34f5-4077-8540-56899f5c0aed.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1476.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0066","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0066.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0019","title":"多种 Unix 系统 NFS rpc.statd 远程文件创建删除漏洞","description":"NFS 服务中的 rpc.statd 组件存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证，可通过向目标系统发送特制的恶意 RPC 请求，利用该漏洞非法删除或创建任意文件。该漏洞影响多种 Unix 操作系统（包括 DG/UX 等），CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等，攻击者利用后可破坏系统文件完整性，进而实施进一步的入侵攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0019"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"1996-04-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:21Z","remediation":"升级 nfs-utils 至修复版本（Linux 系统升级至 0.1.6 以上），或安装对应操作系统的安全补丁。如无需 NFS 服务，可停止 rpc.statd 服务（`service nfs-kernel-server stop`）并禁用端口映射（rpcbind）。在防火墙上限制对 TCP/UDP 111 和 32771 端口的访问，仅允许可信来源连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/135","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/1999/CVE-1999-0019.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0019.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0019","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0019.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m29h-r53r-8j77/GHSA-m29h-r53r-8j77.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0019.json","https://github.com/Heretyc/inntinn/blob/21d34f5ab9fb9cee4ad4306ccb65c7e5b5efe6fb/examples.py","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/rpc_statd.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0066.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0191","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0191.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0078","title":"SCO OpenServer 和 UnixWare pcnfsd 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"pcnfsd（又称 rpc.pcnfsd）服务程序存在输入验证不当漏洞，本地攻击者可通过在 RPC 调用参数中注入恶意参数，进而修改目标系统文件权限或执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 SCO OpenServer 和 UnixWare 等操作系统版本，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 1.9，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":1.9,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0078"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1996-04-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:31Z","remediation":"建议升级 SCO OpenServer 5.0.4 及以上版本或 UnixWare 2.0.1 及以上版本，其中已修复 pcnfsd 参数校验缺陷。若当前系统无法升级，可在 inetd 配置中注释 rpc.pcnfsd 行并重启 inetd 服务以禁用该 RPC 服务作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0078"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0191.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1333","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1333.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1103","title":"DEC OSF/1 dxconsole 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 远程桌面授权服务远程代码执行漏洞","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1103"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-04-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:43Z","remediation":"升级 DEC OSF/1 至 3.2C 以上版本，或安装 DEC 官方安全补丁集。如无法升级，可移除 dxconsole 的 setuid 位或限制可执行权限，仅授权可信用户使用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/g-18.shtml","http://www.cert.org/vendor_bulletins/VB-96.05.dec","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7138.php","http://www.tao.ca/fire/bos/0209.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94380d498cb52b65d051c9bd443b6f2aa85bf8ec/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1103.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1103","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-1103.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cdbbe57bd34c799f670485304ef54912650bf03b/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1103.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/799c403529fad0f67d5473eea397e9968232a5ec/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5p9p-6x4x-p4x4/GHSA-5p9p-6x4x-p4x4.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88488/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1103.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--19d1784b-7f1b-4b4f-9e02-9e3dda811549.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--19d1784b-7f1b-4b4f-9e02-9e3dda811549.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1333.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0175","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0175.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0070","title":"Apache NCSA HTTPd test-cgi 目录遍历信息泄露漏洞","description":"Apache 0.8.x/1.0.x 及 NCSA HTTPd 1.x 中的 test-cgi 程序存在目录列表泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可触发该脚本的目录遍历功能，获取服务器上任意目录的文件列表，进而导致敏感信息（如配置文件、脚本源码等）泄露。该漏洞影响早期版本的 Apache 和 NCSA HTTPd 服务器，利用方式简单，危害中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0070"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1996-04-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:30Z","remediation":"升级到 Apache 2.0 及以上版本（该问题在 Apache 1.3.x 已修复），或直接移除 test-cgi 脚本及所在目录的执行权限。同时禁用 Apache 中 Options 指令的 Indexes 参数，防止目录列表泄露。如无法升级，在 httpd.conf 中将 test-cgi 目录的访问控制设置为 Deny from all。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rc5d27fc1e76dc5650e1a3f1db1de403120f4c2d041cb7352850455c2%40%3Cusers.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20435","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34851454a7b07498072de47d56f63daa4a4f524d/1999/CVE-1999-0070.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5917e2b15694e167c1fd9ad85775b2bdfc5fe29c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0070.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0070","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0070.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/c8b30957414aefbd6ba0b766db0d40593ba36fba/references/CVE-1999-0070-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a55bddfc5dd568e972e08b703ab596ed3580b7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0070.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0070.md","https://github.com/decal/werdlists/blob/81edb463f7f6311c85defefaf75ac9cd58e5cfb9/exploit-info/symantec-attack-signatures.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/49899a53e9c2e620c99e0234afe3c50e512ad851/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-93fg-xppj-x2xf/GHSA-93fg-xppj-x2xf.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/0xxx/cve-1999-0070.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0175.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0175.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0291","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0291.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0141","title":"Oracle Java Bytecode Verifier 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Java Bytecode Verifier（字节码验证器）存在安全验证缺陷，恶意 Java Applet 可绕过沙箱限制，在用户浏览器中执行任意系统命令。攻击者通过构造特制的恶意 Applet 并嵌入网页，诱使用户使用 Netscape Navigator 等浏览器访问即可触发漏洞。该漏洞影响已安装 Java 运行环境的系统，CVSS 评分 3.7，危害等级低。建议用户禁用浏览器中的 Java Applet 支持或升级到修复版本。","severity":"LOW","score":3.7,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0141"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-03-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:41Z","remediation":"升级至 Sun Security Bulletin #134 对应修补版本（JDK 1.1.6 及以上），或安装 Netscape Navigator 安全更新。在现代系统上，由于所有主流浏览器已移除 Java Applet 支持，卸载旧版 JRE（如 Java 6/7/8）并在浏览器中彻底禁用 Java 插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/134"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0291.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0167","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0167.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0067","title":"NCSA HTTPd phf CGI 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"NCSA HTTPd 服务器自带的 phf CGI 程序存在操作系统命令注入漏洞（CWE-78）。远程攻击者无需身份认证，即可通过向 phf 发送包含 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等）的特制 HTTP 请求，在服务器端以 Web 进程权限执行任意系统命令。该漏洞可导致完全控制目标服务器，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0067"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1996-03-20T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:30Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 NCSA httpd，升级至 Apache httpd 或 Nginx 等现代 Web 服务器，并删除或禁用 cgi-bin/phf 脚本。临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器配置中限制 CGI 目录访问权限，对用户输入过滤 shell 元字符（;、`、|、$ 等），防止恶意字符传递至 CGI 程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1996-06.html","http://www.osvdb.org/136","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/629"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0167.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0292","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0292.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0142","title":"Netscape Navigator Java Applet 安全限制绕过漏洞","description":"Netscape Navigator 2.0 及 Java Developer's Kit 1.0 中 Java Applet Security Manager 实现存在安全漏洞，未能正确限制小程序的网络连接权限，导致恶意 Java Applet 可突破安全沙箱限制，与任意远程主机建立网络连接，从而可能绕过同源策略窃取敏感信息或发起进一步攻击。攻击者只需诱导用户访问嵌有恶意小程序的网页即可触发，利用方式简单。该漏洞影响早期 Java 小程序的安全隔离机制，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0142"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1996-03-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:41Z","remediation":"升级至 Netscape Navigator 2.01 及以上版本或更新 Java 运行时环境，从根本上消除 Java 安全管理器绕过漏洞。亦可完全禁用浏览器中 Java Applet 执行权限，或更换为现代浏览器以彻底规避此类风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0142"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0292.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0418","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0418.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0233","title":"Microsoft IIS 1.0 .cmd/.bat 文件远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 1.0、Netscape Server 1.0/1.12 及 O'Reilly WebSite Professional 1.1b 等早期 Web 服务器在处理 .cmd 和 .bat 文件请求时存在远程命令执行漏洞。远程攻击者通过向受影响服务器发送包含 .cmd 或 .bat 后缀的 HTTP 请求，可导致服务器直接执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响多种主流 Web 服务器软件，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0233"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1996-02-25T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:58Z","remediation":"对于 Microsoft IIS 1.0，打开 Internet 服务管理器，删除 .bat 和 .cmd 扩展名的脚本映射，或升级至 IIS 2.0 及以上版本（已于后续版本中默认移除该映射）。对于 Netscape Server 1.0/1.12，升级至 Netscape Enterprise Server 2.0 或更高版本。对于 O'Reilly WebSite Professional 1.1b，升级至 WebSite Professional 2.0 或更高版本。鉴于以上产品均已终止支持且停止更新，强烈建议迁移至仍在安全维护周期内的现代 Web 服务器产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ148188","http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ155056","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20445","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ead50dc12e50bdd7f50b53d9d01c9f9946862c44/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0233.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0233","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0233.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ed191c1149de50e461e9a357f4a3a22e603f0d1/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0233.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b7a93df7f7051799495805bc211adea8d202dae7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2752-8gwx-98x4/GHSA-2752-8gwx-98x4.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-iis.rules","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/0xxx/cve-1999-0233.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0233.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/slacker247/GPDA/blob/fa9006d0877a691f1ddffe88799c844a3e8a669a/Aries/Sodi/Run/IDSrules/rule.989"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0418.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0418.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0418.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0293","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0293.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0143","title":"MIT Kerberos 4 密钥服务器会话密钥伪造漏洞","description":"Kerberos 4 密钥服务器存在会话密钥破解漏洞，攻击者可通过破解并伪造会话密钥来伪装成任意合法用户身份。该漏洞影响 Kerberos 4 密钥分发中心（KDC），攻击者无需高级权限即可实施身份欺骗攻击，可能导致未授权访问受保护网络资源。CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0143"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-02-21T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:41Z","remediation":"升级至 Kerberos 5 协议（MIT Kerberos 1.11+ 或 Active Directory 均已废弃 Kerberos 4），Kerberos 5 使用更强的加密算法和安全的会话密钥协商机制。如在旧系统中仍启用 Kerberos 4 兼容模式，应关闭 krb4 支持（设置 KRB5_KRB4_COMPAT=no），并禁用 Telnet/FTP 等明文传输通道以减少凭据泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0143"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0293.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0236","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0236.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0103","title":"多厂商 UDP Echo/Chargen 服务数据包风暴拒绝服务漏洞","description":"UDP炸弹或UDP数据包风暴漏洞（UDP bomb/UDP packet storm）是指攻击者利用 UDP echo（回显）和 chargen（字符生成）等服务的组合特性，向目标服务器发送伪造源地址的数据包，使服务之间形成无限循环的数据包风暴，从而导致目标系统网络带宽耗尽、服务不可用。该漏洞影响早期 UNIX/Linux 系统中默认启用的 UDP 服务，属于拒绝服务类漏洞。攻击者无需认证即可远程发起攻击，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。该漏洞自 1999 年被发现至今仍可在未正确配置 UDP 服务的系统中利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0103"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1996-02-08T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:35Z","remediation":"禁用不必要的 UDP 服务（如 echo、chargen、time 等），在 /etc/inetd.conf 或 systemd socket 配置中注释或删除对应行并重启服务。在边界防火墙/路由器上阻止外部对 UDP 端口 7 (echo)、19 (chargen) 的访问，并限制内部 UDP 广播流量以防止放大攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSMA-18-233-01","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/80171"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0236.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1285","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1285.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1491","title":"Red Hat Linux 2.1 abuse.console 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 2.1 的 abuse.console 程序使用相对路径而非绝对路径来定位和执行 undrv 程序，本地攻击者可通过在 PATH 环境变量中插入包含恶意木马程序的目录路径，诱使 abuse.console 加载并执行攻击者构造的恶意程序，从而在系统上以提升的权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 2.1 版本，属于本地权限提升漏洞，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限才能利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1491"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-02-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:33Z","remediation":"升级至 Red Hat Linux 2.2 或更高版本，或修改 abuse.console 脚本，将对 undrv 的调用改为绝对路径（如 /usr/bin/undrv）；若无需该功能，可移除 abuse.console 的 setuid 位并限制仅 root 可执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167418994&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/354","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19279","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b4109a5f204e995e8b4c403f2d8e63073bf1f4d9/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1491.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1491","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1491.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9a5386d000a40888283d918a46b8928ffcbfca7b/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1491.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fe37e86b4ab6d44c1acc95d76e30f97043bfd67f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-33qc-p77x-82rf/GHSA-33qc-p77x-82rf.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1491.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/354/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fa7703be-a94b-4bb7-ad05-d57d42680df8.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--fa7703be-a94b-4bb7-ad05-d57d42680df8.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1285.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1478","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1478.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1319","title":"SGI IRIX Object Server 配置错误漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 操作系统的 object server 程序存在配置缺陷漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用特定配置下的服务缺陷，通过向目标系统发送特制请求触发该漏洞，从而获取 root 超级用户权限。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 5.2 至 6.1 版本，CVSS v2.0 评分为 10.0，危害等级严重。SGI 已发布安全公告（19960101-01-PX）提供补丁修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1319"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1996-01-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:11Z","remediation":"SGI IRIX 已停止支持多年，无官方安全补丁可用。建议将系统升级至 IRIX 6.5.30 或更高版本（该系列中最新稳定版），或立即禁用 object server 程序：以 root 权限执行 `/etc/init.d/objectserver stop` 并注释 `/etc/inetd.conf` 中的 objectserver 条目。同时配置防火墙，限制 TCP 631 端口仅允许受信任主机访问。长远来看，建议将业务迁移至仍在安全维护期的 Linux/Unix 操作系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7430.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b8e5ca8c68c148c2498e70421f33344e9cff1e8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1319.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1319","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1319.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/929f101fd7b4d4314a4b92f62a8cc2523c6d76f0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1319.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-33r7-3pp9-8f97/GHSA-33r7-3pp9-8f97.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1319.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000074.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a8bd9166-2cb2-4289-a5ec-be37bc670bf3.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1478.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1382","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1382.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1186","title":"rxvt 终端模拟器 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"rxvt 是一款 Unix 系统下的终端模拟器。当该程序在编译时启用了 PRINT_PIPE 选项后，其 setuid root 安装版本会错误地将 -print-pipe 命令行参数所指定的管道程序以 root 权限执行。本地普通用户可借此以 root 身份运行任意命令，从而造成本地权限提升，完全控制受影响的主机系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1186"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-01-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 rxvt 至已修复版本（≥2.7.6），或重新编译时禁用 PRINT_PIPE 选项（添加 -DNO_PRINT_PIPE 宏），并避免以 setuid root 方式安装 rxvt，同时移除旧版本中 -print-pipe 参数的使用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167418966&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf63c766a0e51c24a528a42a3e26e4fdf58db9e8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1186.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1382.toml"}]